    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "Vasantha Sena. Do not even utter her name to me!......... That dog in the place where my mother should be......... Unless I make her writhe like a worm fallen into burning embers—and seat my mother in the royal hall... I am not Manoharan.",
